1
00:00:07,323 --> 00:00:08,843
You're here.

2
00:00:13,857 --> 00:00:18,643
Ah, Seong-ho texted, said
he'd be running a bit late...

3
00:00:20,184 --> 00:00:23,604
Thanks for the soup.

4
00:00:23,636 --> 00:00:24,637
Huh?

5
00:00:29,029 --> 00:00:31,448
The soup you made.

6
00:00:31,448 --> 00:00:33,867
It really helped
with the hangover.

7
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:39,247
Ah... glad
your stomach's settled.

8
00:00:39,497 --> 00:00:42,500
Go get changed, yeah?

9
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:56,973
The body's always tighter
the day after drinking.

10
00:00:57,432 --> 00:01:00,226
When that happens
you need to focus here...

11
00:01:00,226 --> 00:01:03,229
and here.

12
00:01:03,646 --> 00:01:06,649
Now inhale.

13
00:01:09,110 --> 00:01:11,988
Good. Exhale.

14
00:01:11,988 --> 00:01:13,490
You're not going to

15
00:01:14,240 --> 00:01:17,243
tickle me today, are you?

16
00:01:17,494 --> 00:01:20,497
No distractions. Focus.

17
00:01:23,792 --> 00:01:26,795
Does it hurt?

18
00:01:28,463 --> 00:01:31,466
No... it actually feels good.

19
00:01:32,425 --> 00:01:34,260
Good. Let's keep going.

20
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:36,596
Deep breath...

21
00:01:36,596 --> 00:01:38,306
Um, actually...

22
00:01:38,306 --> 00:01:41,351
Hey, Ji-sung!

23
00:01:47,232 --> 00:01:48,232
Huh?

24
00:01:49,109 --> 00:01:50,235
Who is that?
